Exit code: 0
---
Stdout:
ST504  Unexpected GraphQL Response                                        MEDIUM
checks not_a_server_error

The GraphQL API returned a JSON value other than an object, such as a list, a
string or null.

Why it matters
  Every GraphQL client expects an object with `data` or `errors`. A list or a
  bare string breaks the client's response parser before application code sees
  the result.

Example
  query { books { title } }

  200 OK
  Content-Type: application/json

  ["Dune", "Emma"]

    - ST504 Unexpected GraphQL Response

        GraphQL response is not a JSON object

How Schemathesis found it
  Schemathesis parses the body as JSON when the status is in `expected-statuses`
  for `not_a_server_error`: 2xx, 3xx and 4xx by default. It does so for positive
  and negative test cases. A body that is not JSON reports as ST109. JSON that
  is not an object reports as this code.

  The message is the same for every case. The response body below it shows the
  value the server sent.

How to fix
  The API is wrong: the schema has no say over the response envelope. Return an
  object such as `{"data": ...}`. Check handlers that write the body themselves,
  such as error handlers or middleware.

Verify the fix
  Run `st replay <case id>` with the ID from the `Test Case ID:` line of the
  failure output. It reruns the stored case and reports whether it still fails;
  once it passes, replay deletes the stored case. The replay needs the run's
  credentials: run it with the same config, or pass `--header`, `--auth` or
  `--auth-wfc`.

Turn it off
  `--exclude-checks not_a_server_error`
  or in schemathesis.toml:
    [checks.not_a_server_error]
    enabled = false
  Also disables:
    ST101  Server error
    ST102  Server error on unexpected Content-Type
    ST109  JSON deserialization error (GraphQL only)
    ST201  API accepted schema-violating request (GraphQL only)
    ST501  GraphQL server error
    ST502  GraphQL schema violation
    ST503  GraphQL client error

Docs  https://schemathesis.readthedocs.io/en/stable/reference/failures/#st504
